# .cursorrules for NexusTrade AI: Multi-Indicator Institutional Crypto Analyzer
# Senior AI Architect Guidelines

- Prefer TypeScript strict mode with zero any types.
- Follow Clean Architecture: separate domain entities, use-cases, and UI controllers.
- Enforce dual-output pattern (Human-readable Markdown + Machine-readable JSON).
- Use Tailwind CSS v4 utility classes exclusively with responsive prefixes.
- Follow UX DNA: strictly implement User Journey flows and Information Architecture defined in Stage 2.
- Keep components modular (< 250 lines) with extracted helper types in /src/types.
